ttle screen on there  so you can see kind of which program you  were in and it did  did a good job it was it was quite heavy  um i do remember that  yeah when i was looking into what's kind  of available now in the  console 2 i didn't even know there was  the older ones with the wire and the  belt pack  yeah awesome living today to have all  these new capabilities  i've actually had almost  every single sound processor since that  one what was really a big deal  maybe two sound processors after freedom  was  there was some automaticity that was  starting to happen so  sound processor would actually monitor  the environment and then change the  program  based on the environment i was in the  hardware  like the microphone i think you'll kind  of appreciate this the microphone and  the processor got better  we cover a ton of all the new headphones  and stuff that comes out it's cool every  year  we're seeing this progression in quality  and background noise filtering and stuff  it's really awesome to see that tech  being pushed forward and  for me it's awesome to see now it's not  only in the latest gadgets that are  coming out but it's in  things like this where it actually  changes people's lives so how's it been  switching over to this one compared to  the previous ones there's definitely  um a difference in off the year this is  the first time where like i have nothing  on my ear  it's just free the other really cool  thing with the kansa 2  oh there's actually a few but um it's  completely wireless like you said so  uh it connects to my my cell phone so  right now i'm actually talking to you  through my cell phone  um there's no wires just like uh you  would like  um you know with wireless headphones uh  essentially  i just have that all built in um as part  of my device that helps me here  but i can also connect to my phone i can  stream  um you know video from my phone  listen uh you know watch netflix or i  can listen to a podcast  which i do while i'm riding m